WEBVTT

00:00:10.830 --> 00:00:11.750
Oka...

00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:15.670
It's okay.

00:00:16.630 --> 00:00:21.000
I'm not afraid to face my destiny.
Please focus on protecting the ritual.

00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:23.790
All right.

00:00:34.250 --> 00:00:35.420
The trees are gorgeous.

00:00:36.040 --> 00:00:39.000
I'm glad I was able to see them together
with you in the end.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:40.880
Oka...

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:44.920
Thank you for everything you've done.

00:00:48.580 --> 00:00:50.170
Once the ritual gets underway,

00:00:50.830 --> 00:00:54.290
the Oni who lurk in the boundary between
our realm and theirs will take physical form

00:00:54.670 --> 00:00:58.130
and do everything they can
to stop the ritual by killing Oka.

00:00:59.130 --> 00:01:03.380
The original purpose of the Yoroi that
we use was to defend this ritual.

00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:05.420
Please keep it safe.

00:01:06.750 --> 00:01:07.830
It's all up to you.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:15.250
If the Shrine Maiden's destiny is
to complete the ritual by offering her life,

00:01:16.290 --> 00:01:22.210
then mine must be to defend these sacred grounds
with my Yoroi and just leave Oka to die.

00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:25.250
That's the way it has to be.

00:01:58.920 --> 00:02:01.750
"I just don't care anymore"

00:02:01.750 --> 00:02:04.540
A reply thrown out

00:02:04.540 --> 00:02:09.330
Briefly blooming then briefly falling, over and over

00:02:10.040 --> 00:02:12.880
Left feeling unsatisfied

00:02:12.880 --> 00:02:15.790
Yes, day by day, I walked on

00:02:15.790 --> 00:02:18.080
Cry, futurity, gloomy

00:02:18.080 --> 00:02:22.080
The twilight still out of reach

00:02:22.380 --> 00:02:24.460
Don't lose your way

00:02:24.460 --> 00:02:27.670
Tighten the twine of dreams

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:30.080
Take me so high

00:02:30.080 --> 00:02:32.920
Start running to a brand new life

00:02:32.920 --> 00:02:35.420
Everything I have in my hand

00:02:35.920 --> 00:02:39.080
Holding onto seven colors

00:02:39.420 --> 00:02:40.960
Go ahead, make my day

00:02:40.960 --> 00:02:44.330
I'll use this fist to rebel even harder!

00:02:44.330 --> 00:02:46.790
Everything I have in my hand

00:02:47.130 --> 00:02:50.540
Sketching ideals and hopes

00:02:50.830 --> 00:02:52.130
I won't let you down

00:02:52.420 --> 00:02:55.420
I'll let this flower bloom forever!

00:02:55.630 --> 00:02:59.080
Believe myself

00:03:05.960 --> 00:03:11.000
<b>Pulse</b>

00:03:15.960 --> 00:03:19.880
<b>FULL</b>

00:03:15.960 --> 00:03:19.880
<b>STEAM</b>

00:03:15.960 --> 00:03:19.880
<b>AHEAD</b>

00:03:16.210 --> 00:03:18.380
This is the way to Oka, right?

00:03:18.380 --> 00:03:19.080
Yeah!

00:03:21.080 --> 00:03:22.460
Kippei! Look out!

00:03:24.540 --> 00:03:26.460
We're going for it! Hang on tight!

00:03:43.670 --> 00:03:45.580
Wh-wh-wh-what the heck are these things?!

00:03:45.580 --> 00:03:46.420
They're Oni!

00:03:46.420 --> 00:03:48.170
Oni?! But they don't have horns!

00:03:48.380 --> 00:03:49.630
Trust me, they're Oni!

00:03:49.630 --> 00:03:50.710
You gotta be kidding!

00:03:50.710 --> 00:03:52.210
Are we in the nether realm already?

00:03:52.670 --> 00:03:53.540
More Oni incoming!

00:03:54.290 --> 00:03:56.540
Not good, not good, not good, not good!

00:03:54.790 --> 00:03:56.540
Oh crap, oh crap, oh crap, oh crap!

00:03:56.540 --> 00:03:58.540
Brakes! Hit the brakes, man!

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:07.790
Ouch, that hurt...

00:04:09.670 --> 00:04:10.880
Kippei! Behind you!

00:04:13.290 --> 00:04:14.830
Leave these things to me, dude!

00:04:14.830 --> 00:04:15.880
Don't be ridiculous!

00:04:15.880 --> 00:04:17.290
There's no time, get going!

00:04:19.170 --> 00:04:20.630
Don't forget this is our youth, Kakeru!

00:04:21.040 --> 00:04:22.130
Our youth?

00:04:22.250 --> 00:04:24.000
And what does it mean to be young?!

00:04:28.170 --> 00:04:29.670
It means never looking back!

00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:35.670
That's right. Keep going...

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:36.880
Hero!

00:04:48.000 --> 00:04:49.420
Fate determines everything.

00:04:51.960 --> 00:04:53.790
They can't live for very long.

00:04:54.880 --> 00:04:56.290
That is their fate.

00:04:59.080 --> 00:05:00.580
I never truly understood it.

00:05:01.040 --> 00:05:04.040
I just accepted the fate given to me,
without so much as a second thought.

00:05:05.170 --> 00:05:06.130
But...

00:05:06.630 --> 00:05:09.710
After I met everyone and explored
some of the outside world,

00:05:09.710 --> 00:05:11.830
I discovered so many fun things!

00:05:12.540 --> 00:05:17.170
Now I understand. The purpose of my existence
is to make sure all of that stays safe.

00:05:18.460 --> 00:05:22.080
I'm terrified and heartbroken
at the thought of saying goodbye.

00:05:22.380 --> 00:05:24.750
But even after I'm gone...

00:05:25.790 --> 00:05:30.000
I know that I'll continue to live
on in everyone's memories!

00:05:31.630 --> 00:05:35.330
We had so many good times together
that I'll never forget.

00:05:37.040 --> 00:05:39.420
And that's more than enough for me!

00:06:05.540 --> 00:06:07.210
The gate... is opening.

00:06:19.130 --> 00:06:21.290
Youth is power!

00:06:37.040 --> 00:06:38.540
This is just like 8 years ago...

00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:41.920
Hang on, Oka!

00:06:44.830 --> 00:06:47.960
The strange monsters appear to be heading
for that pillar of light!

00:06:56.040 --> 00:06:59.420
The strange monsters appear to be
heading for that pillar of light!

00:07:01.880 --> 00:07:03.460
What on earth was that?!

00:07:03.460 --> 00:07:04.380
Kaede?

00:07:05.540 --> 00:07:07.540
You okay, Mom? Hang in there!

00:07:18.330 --> 00:07:21.380
You're okay no- whoaaaaaa!

00:07:25.170 --> 00:07:26.250
Misokatsu!

00:07:27.710 --> 00:07:30.080
Oh, Misokatsu! I'm so glad you're okay!

00:07:30.420 --> 00:07:31.580
Thank you so much!

00:07:31.830 --> 00:07:32.790
Doesn't matter.

00:07:33.540 --> 00:07:36.670
<b>Breaking News:</b>

00:07:33.540 --> 00:07:36.670
<b>Hoard of monsters attacks city</b>

00:07:33.540 --> 00:07:36.670
<b>Unknown army fights them off!</b>

00:07:33.540 --> 00:07:36.670
<b>BREAKING: HEROES FEND OFF STRANGE MONSTERS</b>

00:07:33.550 --> 00:07:36.670
<b>Please keep yourself safe! [All roads are closed] Toyota City Traffic Operations not expected to resume soon</b>

00:07:33.670 --> 00:07:35.170
Real life heroes!

00:07:35.330 --> 00:07:39.790
We have reports pouring in from all across the city
of mysterious powered suits fighting the monsters.

00:07:36.670 --> 00:07:40.540
<b>BREAKING: HEROES FEND OFF STRANGE MONSTERS</b>

00:07:46.210 --> 00:07:49.540
We're the last line of defense in keeping the ritual safe.

00:07:49.880 --> 00:07:51.080
Pretty ironic, huh?

00:07:55.210 --> 00:07:57.420
Kaede will be okay, so just relax.

00:07:57.630 --> 00:07:59.630
I know that. I'm not worried.

00:08:00.880 --> 00:08:04.330
Listen. We've already strayed too far from the path.

00:08:04.670 --> 00:08:06.080
We can't go back at this point.

00:08:06.750 --> 00:08:08.670
I'm not going to try and back out now.

00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:11.380
I'm ready. I know what I have to do.

00:08:13.630 --> 00:08:15.380
The Oni are just a source of power.

00:08:15.880 --> 00:08:17.500
They're not good or evil.

00:08:18.130 --> 00:08:19.880
But Oni eat people...

00:08:20.710 --> 00:08:24.130
Only because those people summoned
the Oni with their desires.

00:08:24.790 --> 00:08:27.130
So what? You think that means they deserve it?

00:08:27.880 --> 00:08:29.630
How we use the power is what matters.

00:08:29.750 --> 00:08:32.170
For all we know, there could be people
who did something amazing

00:08:32.170 --> 00:08:34.420
or found happiness with the Oni's power.

00:08:35.380 --> 00:08:36.580
That makes me sick...

00:08:36.830 --> 00:08:39.790
If you think that's bad,
then you don't even know the worst of it.

00:08:41.540 --> 00:08:43.330
Imagine someone's wish was to control the Oni's power.

00:08:43.330 --> 00:08:47.040
Then suppose that person got possessed
by an Oni trying to fulfill that wish.

00:08:47.380 --> 00:08:52.920
If they were to become a Shinja... that means an Oni
with the ability to enslave other Oni would be born.

00:08:53.250 --> 00:08:55.330
Wait a minute. Is that really possible...?

00:08:56.000 --> 00:08:59.460
It is. An Oni that enslaves and absorbs other Oni exists.

00:09:01.000 --> 00:09:02.460
And the name that it goes by is...

00:09:03.000 --> 00:09:03.830
Shuten.

00:09:04.460 --> 00:09:06.170
Don't say that name out loud.

00:09:22.580 --> 00:09:23.330
Ryo!

00:09:24.130 --> 00:09:25.250
Kaede!

00:09:25.580 --> 00:09:28.420
You were able to transform?
Great, that means you can fight again!

00:09:29.000 --> 00:09:29.920
What about Ibara?

00:09:30.290 --> 00:09:31.540
He's not here.

00:09:32.290 --> 00:09:33.290
But he's still alive.

00:09:33.670 --> 00:09:37.920
I know it! Because Ibara's been trying
to tell me something this whole time.

00:09:38.830 --> 00:09:40.580
Are you saying your hearts are connected?

00:09:41.080 --> 00:09:44.380
I have to go meet with Oka! Before the ritual ends!

00:09:44.670 --> 00:09:45.790
But what for?

00:09:46.080 --> 00:09:48.290
I'm not just going to stand by and let her die!

00:09:48.580 --> 00:09:50.170
Huh? What does that mean?

00:09:52.040 --> 00:09:54.710
The ritual can only be completed
with Lady Oka's sacrifice.

00:09:54.710 --> 00:09:56.460
And Oka is ready to die for it.

00:09:56.920 --> 00:09:57.880
You can't be serious.

00:09:59.960 --> 00:10:03.250
This is a sick joke! Why the hell does Oka have to die?!

00:10:03.250 --> 00:10:04.580
You saw what we're up against.

00:10:05.330 --> 00:10:08.130
Hordes of Oni are invading.
What else are we supposed to do?

00:10:11.880 --> 00:10:12.880
Dammit!

00:10:13.630 --> 00:10:14.670
There is a chance.

00:10:14.880 --> 00:10:15.500
What?

00:10:15.500 --> 00:10:16.880
Ibara showed me a way.

00:10:17.170 --> 00:10:20.040
A long time ago, he saved one of the Shrine Maidens.

00:10:20.420 --> 00:10:21.420
Ibara did?

00:10:22.040 --> 00:10:25.580
I don't know if I can do the same.
But... I have to go and try!

00:10:26.000 --> 00:10:27.130
What makes you think you can...

00:10:35.170 --> 00:10:36.210
Get moving, Kakeru.

00:10:36.540 --> 00:10:37.880
It's your job to protect Lady Oka now.

00:10:38.500 --> 00:10:39.790
Please don't let her die!

00:10:40.380 --> 00:10:42.130
I know that you can save her, Kakeru!

00:10:42.420 --> 00:10:43.170
Right!

00:10:47.040 --> 00:10:48.330
I hardly recognized the kid.

00:10:49.130 --> 00:10:49.960
Mr. Issa!

00:10:50.500 --> 00:10:53.380
Those two... I'm sure they can pull it off.

00:10:54.170 --> 00:10:57.420
Okay. We need to stay focused
on taking care of things out here!

00:10:58.920 --> 00:11:01.130
Absolutely nothing is going to get passed us!

00:11:19.130 --> 00:11:22.830
Listen! I taste bad! You don't wanna eat me!

00:11:25.380 --> 00:11:29.250
Everything has a proper place to which it belongs.
Return from whence you came.

00:11:38.040 --> 00:11:40.670
This power... it's Lady Oka's!

00:11:41.000 --> 00:11:43.330
So this is what she's willing to offer her life for...

00:11:52.130 --> 00:11:53.080
Look, shooting stars!

00:11:53.080 --> 00:11:54.540
Wow! So beautiful!

00:11:56.460 --> 00:11:58.000
The Oni are leaving.

00:11:58.790 --> 00:12:00.460
And returning to the nether realm.

00:12:01.790 --> 00:12:03.170
Which means, Oka will soon...

00:12:08.960 --> 00:12:10.330
You again.

00:12:10.920 --> 00:12:11.790
What do you want?!

00:12:12.710 --> 00:12:14.130
I came to talk with Oka.

00:12:14.750 --> 00:12:17.330
I'm not going to let you lead Oka astray.

00:12:17.670 --> 00:12:18.420
Ms. Benio!

00:12:19.000 --> 00:12:20.540
What do you think it means to be in love?

00:12:21.170 --> 00:12:21.830
Huh?

00:12:22.040 --> 00:12:23.460
It means never hesitating!

00:12:24.630 --> 00:12:26.710
Enough of your bullshit!

00:12:36.000 --> 00:12:37.000
Shikizakura.

00:12:41.040 --> 00:12:42.040
Shikizakura!

00:12:52.960 --> 00:12:54.380
Return from whence you came.

00:12:55.790 --> 00:12:57.460
It's been 8 long years.

00:12:58.830 --> 00:13:01.210
And now the moment I've awaited has finally come.

00:13:01.630 --> 00:13:02.460
Yes.

00:13:08.080 --> 00:13:10.630
Those 8 years took forever to go by.

00:13:14.960 --> 00:13:16.630
Ukon!

00:13:17.210 --> 00:13:18.830
I was so anxious while waiting...

00:13:18.830 --> 00:13:20.920
For this chance!

00:13:23.880 --> 00:13:25.250
Why betray me?

00:13:29.630 --> 00:13:34.040
You know that I was on the verge
of granting your dearest wish.

00:13:34.750 --> 00:13:38.630
The Kijima family... has never served the likes of you!

00:13:40.170 --> 00:13:42.000
We serve the Shrine Maiden!

00:13:43.750 --> 00:13:45.420
I have fallen to his power.

00:13:46.130 --> 00:13:49.880
To the overlord who consumes
both human and Oni alike... Shuten.

00:13:50.580 --> 00:13:52.500
His greed knows no bounds.

00:13:52.960 --> 00:13:56.000
I have no doubt he will one day try
to engulf our world in its entirety.

00:13:59.830 --> 00:14:02.000
Would you be willing to help me out?

00:14:02.210 --> 00:14:04.830
Let's work together and try to prepare for that time.

00:14:14.210 --> 00:14:19.040
The gems left my body because of the ritual, but
did you really think I would leave myself defenseless?

00:14:20.330 --> 00:14:21.710
You pitiful fool.

00:14:22.000 --> 00:14:24.920
I've consumed more humans
and Oni than you can imagine.

00:14:25.210 --> 00:14:29.080
I have enslaved a nearly infinite amount of souls!

00:14:34.960 --> 00:14:37.380
Always keep an ace up your sleeve if you want to win.

00:14:37.790 --> 00:14:39.080
Good thing I did.

00:14:42.040 --> 00:14:42.750
Now, Haruko!

00:14:42.750 --> 00:14:43.460
Okay!

00:14:46.170 --> 00:14:47.960
When Lady Oka opens the gate,

00:14:48.040 --> 00:14:50.750
all of the Oni that he's consumed
will be forced out of his body.

00:14:51.330 --> 00:14:53.210
No matter how strong Shuten is...

00:14:53.500 --> 00:14:55.130
he'll just be a regular Shinja after that.

00:14:55.460 --> 00:14:57.540
So what are you telling me to do?

00:14:58.130 --> 00:14:59.460
All you have to do is watch.

00:14:59.960 --> 00:15:00.830
But...

00:15:01.290 --> 00:15:02.960
If I fail to stop him...

00:15:04.040 --> 00:15:05.380
then you take him out.

00:15:24.830 --> 00:15:27.380
What are you doing?! Forget about me and shoot!

00:15:27.960 --> 00:15:29.040
I can't do it!

00:15:29.630 --> 00:15:30.380
Come on!

00:15:30.630 --> 00:15:32.500
You're asking me to do the impossible!

00:15:32.830 --> 00:15:34.790
This pathetic little act is over!

00:15:49.250 --> 00:15:50.420
It's time to go.

00:15:51.580 --> 00:15:53.290
Let's pay Kaede a visit.

00:15:54.250 --> 00:15:56.080
Then we'll make her all ours.

00:15:56.960 --> 00:16:00.290
Don't worry. You have more than enough power now.

00:16:01.630 --> 00:16:03.920
But I... I don't...

00:16:07.960 --> 00:16:11.380
How amusing. So you were one of us, eh?

00:16:11.920 --> 00:16:14.330
Then... obey me!

00:16:17.290 --> 00:16:18.960
We're doomed.

00:16:19.790 --> 00:16:22.670
Yes. There is an Oni inside of me.

00:16:23.250 --> 00:16:24.920
And it can grant my wish.

00:16:25.670 --> 00:16:28.170
So... I will...

00:16:30.630 --> 00:16:34.080
Wanting to become Kaede...
wanting to avoid being abandoned...

00:16:34.210 --> 00:16:35.500
Those aren't my wishes!

00:16:38.710 --> 00:16:39.920
I finally get it!

00:16:40.420 --> 00:16:45.000
What I really wanted was to better myself
and become worthy of standing alongside Kaede!

00:16:45.000 --> 00:16:47.250
To walk shoulder-to-shoulder with her!

00:16:56.580 --> 00:16:58.710
Why didn't you do what I told you?

00:16:59.630 --> 00:17:01.580
Because I wanted to save your life.

00:17:02.290 --> 00:17:04.210
Even after I manipulated you?

00:17:04.790 --> 00:17:06.210
I didn't do it for you.

00:17:07.290 --> 00:17:08.960
I did because I want to save people.

00:17:09.540 --> 00:17:11.920
Because... that's what a hero does.

00:17:13.380 --> 00:17:15.290
A hero, huh?

00:17:21.960 --> 00:17:22.830
This is bad!

00:17:23.540 --> 00:17:25.920
Instead of the endless void that is infinity,

00:17:26.290 --> 00:17:29.420
rejoice at the fact that you will now become a part of me!

00:17:30.250 --> 00:17:34.630
In all of heaven and earth,
the only existence that persists...

00:17:34.630 --> 00:17:36.170
is MINE!

00:17:39.540 --> 00:17:40.960
What the hell is happening?!

00:17:41.290 --> 00:17:42.130
Oka!

00:17:57.880 --> 00:17:58.920
Am I seeing this right?

00:18:00.540 --> 00:18:02.380
My name is Shuten!

00:18:02.670 --> 00:18:09.710
Be it human or Oni or even this world itself, I shall
consume everything until there is no trace left!

00:18:11.460 --> 00:18:14.380
Father...? Oh no!

00:18:16.330 --> 00:18:19.000
Shit! How did I never realize it was him all along?!

00:18:19.420 --> 00:18:22.080
I greatly appreciate you opening the gate for me.

00:18:22.380 --> 00:18:26.290
You used us all. My father
and the entire Myojin bloodline!

00:18:26.830 --> 00:18:29.630
I needed someone to open this immense gate.

00:18:29.630 --> 00:18:34.210
It was the only way I could bring
my body over from the nether realm.

00:18:35.210 --> 00:18:36.630
It's my fault...?

00:18:37.170 --> 00:18:39.040
All of that, for this...?

00:18:39.630 --> 00:18:42.580
My darling princess. I am so grateful to you.

00:18:42.920 --> 00:18:43.960
But now...

00:18:44.210 --> 00:18:46.080
I have no use for you!

00:18:46.080 --> 00:18:47.790
Oka!

00:18:51.250 --> 00:18:53.460
Hey Oka! I finally found you!

00:18:53.460 --> 00:18:54.420
Kakeru?!

00:18:54.580 --> 00:18:57.500
I thought about it and I don't want you to die.

00:18:57.830 --> 00:18:59.080
Please stay alive!

00:18:59.080 --> 00:19:00.500
That's what I came to tell you!

00:19:00.500 --> 00:19:01.170
Huh?

00:19:02.790 --> 00:19:05.500
A world that can only survive through
your sacrifice is just plain wrong!

00:19:05.500 --> 00:19:09.880
I won't let it happen! I don't care who
or what stands in my way!

00:19:10.210 --> 00:19:12.250
I'll make sure you live through this!

00:19:12.250 --> 00:19:13.830
No matter what!

00:19:14.540 --> 00:19:16.460
I'll never give up!

00:19:16.710 --> 00:19:19.040
Can you hear me, Ibara? I know you're out there!

00:19:19.210 --> 00:19:20.960
Ibara!

00:19:21.130 --> 00:19:23.540
I already feasted upon Ibara.

00:19:24.670 --> 00:19:26.630
Ah, I love that look.

00:19:26.920 --> 00:19:30.750
Come. I'm going to crush
your precious hope into a million pieces,

00:19:30.750 --> 00:19:33.170
and then enjoy dining upon your soul!

00:19:38.040 --> 00:19:39.040
Kakeru!

00:19:53.380 --> 00:19:58.330
I hope that this moment never ends

00:19:58.630 --> 00:20:02.330
I hope that it continues for decades to come

00:20:04.040 --> 00:20:08.750
Becoming unable to even wear pretty outfits

00:20:09.290 --> 00:20:13.130
In a world where only I have passed on

00:20:14.460 --> 00:20:17.290
The cider I disliked that day

00:20:17.290 --> 00:20:19.500
The cry of the missing cicadas

00:20:19.880 --> 00:20:21.830
Drowning into fate

00:20:21.830 --> 00:20:24.880
Not knowing how to struggle

00:20:25.420 --> 00:20:29.750
It's almost as if I'm invisible to everyone

00:20:30.630 --> 00:20:33.630
I don't even feel the urge to resist

00:20:35.130 --> 00:20:39.290
After you helped pulled me along

00:20:39.920 --> 00:20:43.170
I saw the beautiful colors of the world

00:20:43.170 --> 00:20:45.790
In the season of blooming cherry blossoms

00:20:46.040 --> 00:20:49.960
Captivated by that innocent smile

00:20:50.540 --> 00:20:54.000
There is nothing that can't be changed

00:20:54.000 --> 00:20:58.000
And that's true of any sad future too, right?

00:21:10.710 --> 00:21:11.830
Kakeru?

00:21:12.330 --> 00:21:13.540
Kakeru?!

00:21:15.040 --> 00:21:16.000
Kakeru!

00:21:17.630 --> 00:21:19.540
No!

00:21:20.460 --> 00:21:21.250
Oka!

00:21:24.250 --> 00:21:27.040
Ah, the poor little Myojin girls. How sad.

00:21:27.420 --> 00:21:30.670
If only your mother had done
what she was supposed to...

00:21:31.040 --> 00:21:34.380
then you could have avoided all this suffering!

00:21:35.250 --> 00:21:36.170
Our mother...?

00:21:36.540 --> 00:21:38.080
You shut your damn mouth!

00:21:38.290 --> 00:21:39.040
Monster!

00:21:39.710 --> 00:21:41.460
I'll kill you!

00:21:41.460 --> 00:21:42.880
As if you could!

00:21:43.420 --> 00:21:44.290
Big sis!

00:21:49.540 --> 00:21:53.880
You never questioned your destiny.
You simply clung to it with meaningless faith!

00:21:54.130 --> 00:21:57.380
Then jumped right at the offer
of salvation from the outside!

00:21:57.630 --> 00:22:00.540
Now take a good look at where it's gotten you!

00:22:01.460 --> 00:22:03.330
Is that all you have to say for yourself?

00:22:04.710 --> 00:22:05.670
What?

00:22:06.170 --> 00:22:10.170
You can stand there and shoot your mouth off
all you want. But it's not going to discourage me!

00:22:11.170 --> 00:22:15.210
I made my choice. To send everything
back to where it belongs.

00:22:15.790 --> 00:22:17.710
Even if it drains the life from me...

00:22:18.290 --> 00:22:22.330
Our world and the nether realm.
Humans and Oni. Fate and blood!

00:22:23.460 --> 00:22:25.960
I'll sever those connections! All of them!

00:22:26.750 --> 00:22:29.380
You impudent brat!

00:22:33.000 --> 00:22:35.460
Oka!

00:22:36.330 --> 00:22:38.420
Hey Kakeru! It's time for the final episode!

00:22:38.420 --> 00:22:40.250
We've really come a long way, huh Ibara?

00:22:40.250 --> 00:22:43.080
Yep. Guess I better say the episode title,
seeing as how I'm the main character and all!

00:22:43.080 --> 00:22:44.920
Hold on! I'm the main character of this show!

00:22:44.920 --> 00:22:45.750
Ugh! Piss off!

00:22:45.750 --> 00:22:46.750
Oh, just shut up!

00:22:45.920 --> 00:22:50.880
<b>Future</b>

00:22:46.750 --> 00:22:48.380
Next time: Future!

00:22:48.790 --> 00:22:50.250
Thank you, Kakeru.
